{
  "$comment": "The fonts the app ships (docs/wizards/brand.md 6): every family the 11 shipped HyperFrames presets name, all OFL-1.1, from fontsource at one pinned version. scripts/fetch-library.mjs downloads the WOFF2 files (latin and latin-ext only, the 10 content languages need no more), checks each against fonts.lock.json and writes FONTS.json with the per-language coverage read from the files. Nothing is fetched at run time. A family that lacks a letter of any of the 10 content languages fails the build (Zoltan, 2026-10-02: such fonts are left out, so the user never has to think about it).",
